description:
Moog is a performance culture that empowers people to achieve great things. Our people enjoy solving interesting technical challenges in a culture where everyone trusts each other to do the right thing. For you, working with us can mean deeper job satisfaction, better rewards, and a great quality of life inside and outside of work.


 Job Title :
Engineering, Software Engineering I 
 Reporting To: 
Team Lead 
 Work Schedule: 
Onsite – Vilnius, LT Skills & Qualifications
 Bachelor‘s degree;
 At least 6 months hands on experience in manual software testing;
 Willingness to work with various testing tools and techniques;
 Exposure to any defect tracking tools (e.g., Jira) is beneficial;
 Good understanding of testing methodologies (ISTQB certification or similar is a plus);
 Proficiency in English and Lithuanian (written and spoken); 
 Strong attention to detail;
 Analytical mindset.


 Salary range (before taxes) for this position is: 
€1 500,00–€2 000,00 
 The final offer depends on experience and competence.
